  "title": "Pickled Beets",
  "description": "Pickled beets are easy to make when you use this classic home canning recipe. Freshly cooked beets are canned in a brine made with sugar, pickling salt and vinegar so you can enjoy fresh-tasting beets all year-round.",
  "authors": [
    "SHARON HOWARD"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:07:48-04:00",
